{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/learn/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/page,_N_T_/learn/van-tharp-position-sizing-idea"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--2DJ2zhzL_dHSrK5QsdDKA--><html lang=\"zh-TW\" data-density=\"comfortable\" data-font-size=\"standard\" class=\"__variable_07e1b6 __variable_cc7473 h-full antialiased\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/3d26d2f3aa81a833-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/604a121a6fa1a135-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/6e1768769e6f59a2-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ab2e3a11646b0499-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/75c047ba52e43fcc.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/aa90c9a426448e43.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/e55779c04dd245e2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/8c57d5c3b938342e.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/3eaf36e367672966.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-100b9d70ed4e49c1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1255-ab54a41c275880be.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-acf4587a940f1946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/learn/%5Bslug%5D/page-f7b99344f7e2ee16.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>范薩普部位觀念怎麼用？3步先算輸得起再談方向｜股市大佬 TradeBoss</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"范·薩普在公開寫作裡反覆強調：很多人研究進場，卻用同一張固定金額面對完全不同的波動。他把部位大小單獨提出來，當成能決定你能不能活過連續虧損的技能。這不是叫你套某一條魔法比例，是叫你把「輸得起」放在「看不看得懂」前面。凱利那篇講過公式的限制；這篇講順序。\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-theme');if(t!=='light'&&t!=='dark')t='dark';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);document.documentElement.style.colorScheme=(t==='light'?'light':'dark');}catch(e){document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme','dark');}})();(function(){try{if(localStorage.getItem('obsidian-comfort-read')==='1')document.documentElement.classList.add('comfort-read');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var s=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-updown');if(s==='us')document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-updown','us');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var prefs=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('bs-preferences-v1')||'{}');var root=document.documentElement;prefs=prefs&&typeof prefs==='object'?prefs:{};root.setAttribute('data-font-size',['standard','large','xlarge','huge'].indexOf(prefs.fontSize)>=0?prefs.fontSize:'standard');root.setAttribute('data-density',prefs.density==='compact'?'compact':'comfortable');}catch(e){}})();</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground selection:bg-cyan/30 review-mode pb-40 lg:pb-16\" data-review-theme=\"dark\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-link fixed left-3 top-3 z-[80] -translate-y-24 rounded-xl bg-accent px-4 py-2 font-black text-bg shadow-lg transition focus:translate-y-0\">跳到主要內容</a><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_wrap__LIQ8G\"><article class=\"LearnArticle_article__2nBbk\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_meta__etj_G\"><a class=\"LearnArticle_cat__GQMlg\" href=\"/learn?c=stories\">人物與市場史</a><span class=\"LearnArticle_read__QEj6a\">閱讀約 3 分鐘</span></p><h1 class=\"LearnArticle_title__0_la8\">范薩普部位觀念怎麼用？3步先算輸得起再談方向</h1><details class=\"LearnArticle_toc__LcSAa\"><summary class=\"LearnArticle_tocSummary__YBddG\">本文目錄</summary><ol class=\"LearnArticle_tocList__Rq_Lz\"><li><a href=\"#sec-1\">一、為什麼要把部位獨立出來</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-2\">二、三步，不需要魔法公式</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-3\">三、和凱利、最大回撤的關係</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-4\">四、方向討論為什麼總是比較吵</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-5\">五、最小動作</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-6\">常見問題 FAQ</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-7\">總結</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-8\">延伸閱讀</a></li></ol></details><div class=\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\">范·薩普在公開寫作裡反覆強調：很多人研究進場，卻用同一張固定金額面對完全不同的波動。他把部位大小單獨提出來，當成能決定你能不能活過連續虧損的技能。這不是叫你套某一條魔法比例，是叫你把「輸得起」放在「看不看得懂」前面。凱利那篇講過公式的限制；這篇講順序。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\"><b class=\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\">本文重點</b><ul class=\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\"><li>進場理由再好，部位錯了仍可以先出局</li><li>先定單筆痛得過的上限，再反推張數</li><li>波動變大時，同一看法要變小，不能憑把握維持原尺寸</li></ul></div><section id=\"sec-1\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">一、為什麼要把部位獨立出來</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">公開論點很直：同一套進場，配上兩種部位，長期路徑可以完全不同。進場決定你對不對的頻率，部位決定你錯的時候還在不在。多數日誌只記進出價，不記這筆佔帳戶多少、對應波動多大。沒記的東西，檢討時會消失。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>進場管頻率</li><li>部位管生存</li><li>日誌要記曝險</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-2\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">二、三步，不需要魔法公式</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">第一步，寫單筆最多輸多少，小到連虧數次你還睡得著。第二步，看這檔最近的波動，反推張數。第三步，有把握也不准突破第一步。三步的精神與海龜用波動算部位相同，只是不必抄當年參數。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\"><table class=\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\"><thead><tr><th>常見做法</th><th>三步做法</th><th>差在哪</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>每次買差不多金額</td><td>每次先定輸得起</td><td>波動大時自動變小</td></tr><tr><td>有把握就加倍</td><td>把握不突破上限</td><td>把握不是證明</td></tr><tr><td>虧了想攤平</td><td>虧了只問減不減</td><td>不讓錯誤變大</td></tr><tr><td>用公式求最佳</td><td>先求做得動</td><td>最佳常晃壞執行</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"sec-3\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">三、和凱利、最大回撤的關係</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">凱利給的是理論成長，實務常要縮小。最大回撤問的是你能不能活。薩普強調的部位，比較靠近「活」這一側。先活，再談優化。</p><ol class=\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\"><li>先寫回撤你活得了多久</li><li>再寫單筆上限</li><li>最後才允許討論放大</li></ol><figure class=\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\">!固定金額!現場加倍!先求最佳公式</div><figcaption class=\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\">常見跳步</figcaption></figure></section><section id=\"sec-4\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">四、方向討論為什麼總是比較吵</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">方向好講、好傳、好爭。部位無聊。公開著作把無聊的那件單獨成章，就是怕你永遠停在方向。台股群組也是如此：人人談會不會漲，很少人談這筆佔自己多少。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>方向吵</li><li>部位靜</li><li>靜的比較決定生存</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-5\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">五、最小動作</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">把最近五筆補上兩欄：這筆最多打算輸多少、實際波動對應的張數合不合理。不合理的，先改尺寸，再改看法。</p></section><section id=\"sec-6\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">常見問題 FAQ</h2><div class=\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\"><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>有沒有通用的單筆上限？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">沒有。要小到你連虧時還做得動。別人的百分比是別人的睡眠。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>看好能不能加大？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">只能在事先寫好的規則裡加大。現場加大，多半是情緒。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>和海龜公式是不是同一套？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">精神相同：波動大就做小。參數不能直接搬。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>紙上交易要不要練部位？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">要。紙上若每次都全倉，練不到這層。</p></details></div></section><section id=\"sec-7\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">總結</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">部位是獨立技能。三步：先定輸得起、再依波動反推、有把握也不破上限。方向再吵，生存仍由尺寸決定。</p></section><section id=\"sec-8\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">延伸閱讀</h2><ul class=\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\"><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/how-to-size-your-position\">部位大小怎麼回推</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/kelly-criterion-can-you-use-it\">凱利公式能直接用嗎</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/turtle-traders-experiment-what-it-really-taught\">海龜實驗</a></li></ul></section><div class=\"LearnArticle_related__9qV55\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_relatedTitle__RXfrl\">相關文章</p><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/how-to-size-your-position\">部位大小怎麼回推</a><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/kelly-criterion-can-you-use-it\">凱利公式能直接用嗎</a><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/turtle-traders-experiment-what-it-really-taught\">海龜實驗</a></div></div></article></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[81259,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[89379,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[98924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[10021,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[10528,[\\\"2