ren\":\"一、為什麼要把部位獨立出來\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-2\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-2\",\"children\":\"二、三步，不需要魔法公式\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-3\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-3\",\"children\":\"三、和凱利、最大回撤的關係\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-4\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-4\",\"children\":\"四、方向討論為什麼總是比較吵\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-5\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-5\",\"children\":\"五、最小動作\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-6\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-6\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-7\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-7\",\"children\":\"總結\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-8\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-8\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\",\"children\":\"范·薩普在公開寫作裡反覆強調：很多人研究進場，卻用同一張固定金額面對完全不同的波動。他把部位大小單獨提出來，當成能決定你能不能活過連續虧損的技能。這不是叫你套某一條魔法比例，是叫你把「輸得起」放在「看不看得懂」前面。凱利那篇講過公式的限制；這篇講順序。\"}],[],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"b\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\",\"children\":\"本文重點\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"進場理由再好，部位錯了仍可以先出局\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"先定單筆痛得過的上限，再反推張數\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"波動變大時，同一看法要變小，不能憑把握維持原尺寸\"}]]}]]}],[[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-1\",{\"id\":\"sec-1\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"一、為什麼要把部位獨立出來\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"公開論點很直：同一套進場，配上兩種部位，長期路徑可以完全不同。進場決定你對不對的頻率，部位決定你錯的時候還在不在。多數日誌只記進出價，不記這筆佔帳戶多少、對應波動多大。沒記的東西，檢討時會消失。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"進場管頻率\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"部位管生存\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"日誌要記曝險\"}]]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-2\",{\"id\":\"sec-2\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"二、三步，不需要魔法公式\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"第一步，寫單筆最多輸多少，小到連虧數次你還睡得著。第二步，看這檔最近的波動，反推張數。第三步，有把握也不准突破第一步。三步的精神與海龜用波動算部位相同，只是不必抄當年參數。\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"常見做法\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"三步做法\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"差在哪\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"每次買差不多金額\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"每次先定輸得起\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"波動大時自動變小\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"有把握就加倍\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"把握不突破上限\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"把握不是證明\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"虧了想攤平\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"虧了只問減不減\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"不讓錯誤變大\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"用公式求最佳\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"先求做得動\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"最佳常晃壞執行\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-3\",{\"id\":\"sec-3\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"三、和凱利、最大回撤的關係\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"凱利給的是理論成長，實務常要縮小。最大回撤問的是你能不能活。薩普強調的部位，比較靠近「活」這一側。先活，再談優化。\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"先寫回撤你活得了多久\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"再寫單筆上限\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"最後才允許討論放大\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"figure\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\",\"children\":\"!固定金額!現場加倍!先求最佳公式\"}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\",\"children\":\"常見跳步\"}]]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-4\",{\"id\":\"sec-4\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[\"$L18\",[\"$L19\",\"$L1a\"]]}],\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\"],\"$L1f\"]}]]}]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"四、方向討論為什麼總是比較吵\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"方向好講、好傳、好爭。部位無聊。公開著作把無聊的那件單獨成章，就是怕你永遠停在方向。台股群組也是如此：人人談會不會漲，很少人談這筆佔自己多少。\"}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"方向吵\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"部位靜\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"靜的比較決定生存\"}]]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-5\",{\"id\":\"sec-5\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"五、最小動作\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"把最近五筆補上兩欄：這筆最多打算輸多少、實際波動對應的張數合不合理。不合理的，先改尺寸，再改看法。\"}]]]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-6\",{\"id\":\"sec-6\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}],[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"有沒有通用的單筆上限？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"沒有。要小到你連虧時還做得動。別人的百分比是別人的睡眠。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"看好能不能加大？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"只能在事先寫好的規則裡加大。現場加大，多半是情緒。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"和海龜公式是不是同一套？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"精神相同：波動大就做小。參數不能直接搬。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"紙上交易要不要練部位？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"要。紙上若每次都全倉，練不到這層。\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-7\",{\"id\":\"sec-7\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"總結\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"部位是獨立技能。三步：先定輸得起、再依波動反推、有把握也不破上限。方向再吵，生存仍由尺寸決定。\"}]]]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-8\",{\"id\":\"sec-8\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}],[[\"$\",\"ul\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-部位大小怎麼回推\",{\"href\":\"/learn/how-to-size-your-position\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"部位大小怎麼回推\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-凱利公式能直接用\",{\"href\":\"/learn/kelly-criterion-can-you-use-it\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"凱利公式能直接用嗎\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-海龜實驗\",{\"href\":\"/learn/turtle-traders-experiment-what-it-really-taught\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"海龜實驗\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"class